# SEO Update Rule

Whenever any feature, page, section, or content is changed, update SEO in the same task.

- Update route/page `title`, `description`, and canonical if affected.
- Update structured data (JSON-LD) to include new services, offers, FAQs, or business details.
- Update crawl assets when needed: `sitemap.xml`, `robots.txt`, and internal links.
- Ensure media SEO basics on changed UI: meaningful `alt` text for informative images and non-blocking loading for non-critical assets.
- Preserve favicon/manifest/meta consistency for mobile and desktop when branding or app icons change.
- Run build/lint checks after SEO edits and verify no regressions.

Before finalizing any implementation, confirm: "feature/content updated + SEO updated together."
